left to right direction

title IF-07 — Conditional execution and separate deployment target
rectangle "Authorized trigger / intended\ndefinition and code revision" as Actor
rectangle "Resumefolio gated attempt /\noutput / target context" as Product
rectangle "Conditional suitable execution\nboundary; not a selected runner" as Execution
rectangle "Separately approved intended\ndeployment target" as Target
Actor -[hidden]right-> Product
Actor --> Product : Exact supported intent +\nscoped authority
Product --> Execution : Only eligible admitted attempt\n/ permitted control
Execution --> Product : Actual attempt state / scoped\noutputs / uncertainty
Product --> Target : Only independently approved\nexact artifact/revision effect
Target --> Product : Actual\nconfirmed/failed/partial/unknown\ntarget result
note bottom of Product
Safe isolation / resources / secret boundaries must actually be established.
Cancellation request is not confirmed stop; retry is new eligible attempt.
Build/merge success does not grant target deployment permission.
end note
legend bottom
Logical boundary/exchange meaning; not software components or chosen protocol/schema.
Full direction, identity, authority, failure, compatibility and evidence limits are in document 12.
Proposed details remain proposed. No real provider, Git, execution, delivery or recovery action performed.
endlegend
@enduml
